        "original_id": "55479969-5cbe-56a0-b9aa-d0432984442c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dražen Petrović, Terry Mills\n- Teams: New Jersey Nets, Portland Trail Blazers, Denver Nuggets\n- Topics: NBA player movement, basketball career\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, Dražen Petrović joined the National Basketball Association after achieving success in European professional basketball during the 1980s.\n- Dražen Petrović was born on October 22, 1964, and he was a Croatian professional basketball player who played shooting guard.\n- During the 1990–91 New Jersey Nets season, the New Jersey Nets acquired Dražen Petrović from the Portland Trail Blazers at midseason.\n- During the 1990–91 New Jersey Nets season, the New Jersey Nets also acquired rookie Terry Mills from the Denver Nuggets at midseason.\n- Dražen Petrović died on June 7, 1993.",
